# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — AppDelivery
# Monorepo: Backend (ASP.NET Core WebApi) + Frontend (Vite / React / TypeScript)
# =============================================================================

# ---- Secretos y variables de entorno ----
# NUNCA commitear secretos reales.
#   Backend .NET  -> usar User Secrets:  dotnet user-secrets init
#   Frontend Vite -> usar .env.local (no commitear) y .env.example (sí commitear)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.local
*.pem
*.pfx
*.key
secrets.json

# ---- Backend: ASP.NET Core / .NET ----
# Salidas de compilación e intermediarios
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
artifacts/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
*.tsbuildinfo

# Archivos de usuario y configuración local de Visual Studio / Rider
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.userprefs
*.sln.docstates
.vs/

# Logs de runtime e IIS
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.log

# Cobertura de pruebas
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
coverage/
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info

# Perfiles de publicación (pueden contener credenciales de deploy)
publish/
[Pp]ublish/
*.pubxml
*.publishproj
*.publishsettings

# Paquetes NuGet (se restauran vía Package Restore)
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/

# ---- Frontend: Node / Vite / React / TypeScript ----
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
.vite/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Logs de npm / yarn / pnpm
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.eslintcache

# ---- Editores ----
# VS Code: excluir el contenido pero permitir compartir extensions/launch/tasks/settings
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.code-workspace
.history/

# ---- Sistema operativo ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
